	"notice": "Connect USB-C to a computer for USB MIDI or to a power supply for standalone routing. The USB socket is a client connection and cannot host a USB keyboard. Configure routing with UxMIDI Tools. MIDI IN receives from instrument OUT; MIDI OUT sends to instrument IN. Stored routing and filters determine which messages reach each port. This is a transport profile with no instrument note or CC map. Exact browser port names are unverified; select this profile manually. Diagrams are simplified connection and control schematics, not scale drawings.",
